--- outcome: KILLED by the persona assertion, not by the escape guard ---
The escape guard is deliberately silenced in this mutant (`let _ = escaped;`),
so the only thing left to catch the split is the agreement between the native
seat and its persona. It caught it:

  left: 2   right: 1
  native_seat.generation = 1, native_id = "coherence-first"
  role_persona.occupancy_generation = 2

A generation-1 native paired with a generation-2 persona -- a seat that never
existed at any instant. That is the hybrid the pre-correction split could
produce, and the regression fails on it without help from the escape guard.
